(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers internal electrification including wiring,) Tj T*
(distribution boards and earthing complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART C — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(- Wiring shall be carried out as per IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(- The supply system shall be TN-S earthing arrangement. Wiring shall be) Tj T*
(concealed in rigid PVC conduits of 1.5mm wall thickness.) Tj T*
(- Wires shall be FR PVC insulated, single core, stranded copper conductor of) Tj T*
(450/750 V grade conforming to IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(- Lighting circuits shall be wired with 1.5 mm² and power circuits with 4 mm²) Tj T*
(copper conductors.) Tj T*
(- Miniature circuit breakers shall conform to IS 8828 and shall have a breaking) Tj T*
(capacity of 10 kA. MCB ratings shall range from 6A to 32A as shown in the single) Tj T*
(line diagram.) Tj T*
(- RCCBs with rated residual operating current of 30 mA shall be provided for all) Tj T*
(socket outlet circuits and shall conform to IS 12640 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(- Earthing shall be carried out in accordance with IS 3043:2018.) Tj T*
(- Two numbers of pipe earth electrodes shall be provided for the main) Tj T*
(distribution board.) Tj T*
(- The earth resistance shall not exceed 1 ohms.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
